      ~ "new SemiEventRegistration(...)" (SemiSpace.java:176-177). No path yields null.
      -->
    <item name="org.semispace.SemiSpaceInterface org.semispace.SemiEventRegistration notify(java.lang.Object, org.semispace.SemiEventListener, long)">
